{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"Ask away, though my answer shall depend on the request...\" Malathor says with a smile.","created_at":"2021-07-25T16:41:08.820000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868895660735332403","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"Bo plays a quiet tune","created_at":"2021-07-25T16:42:36.021000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868896026482868225","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Avrae","id":"261302296103747584","is_bot":1,"username":"Avrae"},"author_id":"261302296103747584","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"","created_at":"2021-07-25T16:42:40.525000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868896045373984769","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"I believe a Giff is plotting, or will be plotting to murder me sometime in the near future. I have a vial of his blood. My goal is to thwart the murder plot and have him arrested.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T16:43:04.061000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868896144091144212","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"Interesting... You speak of a *hippopotamus man*... And he seeks to shed you of your mortal coil?\" Malathor asks as his eyes gleam with interest.","created_at":"2021-07-25T16:44:21.010000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868896466838626365","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"He has threatened as much. Then I arrested him.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T16:44:44.226000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868896564213600336","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"He'll be released from custody on bail today, most likely, and will have freedom to operate.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T16:46:19.724000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868896964761239582","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"Bo smiles as he stares up at the rainbow. He listens patiently.","created_at":"2021-07-25T16:46:36.343000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868897034466394142","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"Mmm, and should I offer you my assistance, would you be willing to do something for me in return Mr. Apgan?\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T16:48:18.829000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868897464323805254","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"That seems only fair. But I must ask, how much is this a burden on you? It would mean a lot to me, but I don't know how much of your time I'd be taking up.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T16:50:02.418000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868897898807562270","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"I have trapped would be murderers before my good man... It would not be an *inconvenience* to me.\" Malathor says with an even wider grin.","created_at":"2021-07-25T16:51:37.256000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868898296586973184","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"Then I would be most happy to do you a service. You are quite possibly saving my life.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T16:52:32.815000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868898529618296832","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"Bo smiles.","created_at":"2021-07-25T16:53:17.104000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868898715379855390","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"All I ask in return, is that you aid Cămăraș Bo in a future endeavor, perhaps guard him on a mission of importance. However should you deign to become *my apprentice* as well, I would be very *pleased.*\" Malathor says shifting on his feet as he looks between the two.","created_at":"2021-07-25T16:55:50.933000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-25T16:56:56.871000Z","id":"868899360585424917","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"Protecting Bo would be an honor sir, and I thank you for laying so light a burden on me in exchange for this favor.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T16:56:53.195000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868899621731172353","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"As for apprenticeship, do allow me to think it over.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T16:57:18.749000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868899728912429056","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"Malathor nods. \"Ofcourse my friend, and do not worry, I will begin my own investigation as soon as I have concluded with Bo's ascension this morning...\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T16:58:10.401000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868899945556639756","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"Ascension? Bo congratulations, maybe?\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T16:58:38.870000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868900064964247552","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
